  m_text: 'wrote up the original story concept for the game, including how the gameplay
    should feel


    Designed the core Gameplay loop cycle of the project


    Designed
    the Majority of the 3D environments within the game, Focusing on Macro development
    and environments. Including, but not limited to:

    Environmental Design and
    Creation

    Custom 3D models

    3D Animations

    3D texturing and Materials

    Lighting
    / Post processing effects

    particals / VFX

    Jumpscares


    Created
    a Custom Attractor AI Script, Hive Mind Script, and Arbitrary Condition System
    for limitless AI Creation


    Sole creator of every single enemy AI present
    within the game, including but not limited to the:

    models

    animations

    designs

    executions

    audio

    Inverse
    Kinematics

    Dynamic Auto-Balancing

    Nervous System Reprogramming

    of
    each core enemy present in the game



    Created a Custom Visual Graph for
    the Editing and management of AI systems


    And I made the Act 3 music :D





'
