--- !u!114 &452097601
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 452097599}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Also spent an ungodly amount of time working on production stuff


    Organized
    our meetings, booked every room and created every single [except for 1, :3] meeting
    poll


    Went sorta insane working on every single primary document, formality,
    or detail related to class submissions or the pipeline


    Wrote up a very
    massive narrative document related to the game, which included but wasnt limited
    to:

    Main Story Concepts

    World Lore

    Overall Game Story

    All
    Technical Writing Features

    All of the narrative world progression

    [and
    yet, every single member of the team still asked questions, whose answers were
    within this document, sorry lol]


    Focused a bit too much on documentation
    and formatting actually (is very passionate about this.)


    Was exceptionally
    hyper focused into gameplay design and incoperation with the narrative [leading
    to.... so many extra meetings with people]


    Developed a pretty sick CSV
    reader to aid to our environmental and explorative story telling

    [which
    by the love of god use to be a .txt reader... holy I did not let that one fly
    and I had choice words when I saw them open NOTEPAD and manually enter CSV values...]


    Programmed
    the base of the interaction system, and hooked it up to the dynamic CSV reader


    Fixed
    completely unrelated bugs in each of their updates


    Wrote literally every
    single line of text that appears at any point in the game [except for the credits!]


    Did
    some super cool SFX for all inspectable items and the nightmare logs, as well
    as the dispensers in the room (that script was fun to write!) Self-sourced some
    of the audio too!


    Made the food dispenser posters :3


    Also arranged
    all the assets for the nightmare logs and decorated the nightmare house a fair
    bit - went insane because of them to be very honest


    lastly... oh my god
    the font and the text visuals. Apologies.'
