  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Those Spiders That liek scream at you really loud for some reason... We
    um,, didn't tell them to do that. I'm very sorry. Things were kind of rough with
    these spiders actually; there were tons of creative differeces that we never
    saw eye to eye on. The first time they screamed at the player we tried to tell
    them it wasn't the vibe we were going for, but they were insistent that we weren't
    seeing "the vision" I   guess... And now this game is a horror game even though
    it was never meant to be... I'm so sorry that the team didn't push back more
    on this. We never wanted this to happen. Oh god we're so sorry. Please forgive
    us. PLEASE. WE'RE SORRY. WE AR
