  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Spent an ungodly amount of time working with Selena on production [thanks
    for all of the support Selena. Despite all of our bickering about how stuff should
    be done LOL, I think we did alright]. If I list all the stuff I did regarding
    that here, we would be here all day lol\n\nBuilt a fully automated CI/CD pipeline
    integrating discord, github, and itch.io together\n\nCreated the Player controller
    and all of its functionalities: Peaking, Leaning, etc.\n\nBuilt the core base
    of the flashlight [Thanks Brayden for making it better lol]\n\nDeveloped the
    Fundamental backend systems spanning across the whole project, including but
    not limited to: \nThe Singleton system, \nBroadcast system, \nGameState System,
    \nCutscene System, \nNotification System, \nConfirmation Pop-up System, \nSave
    System, \nScene Swapper System, \nScene Caching System,\nInventory System, \nPlayer
    Stats System,\nDrawing System,\nLetter System,\nInspection System,\nWorld Clock
    System\n\nSupported in the Ui/UX programming with bug fixes, and implementation
    across: Title Screen, Pause menu, and Settings\n\nHelped Detail and Create the
    following Environments:\nTutorial\nBedroom\nNightmare Realm [Acts 1 + 2 + 3]\nFinale
    Nightmare\n\nBuilt a custom GUI within the editor to aid in the spawning of 3D
    objects, both in and outside of runtime\n\nBuilt a VERY COOL Developer console
    to allow \"cheats\" within the game, for easier debugging [teehee... dont tell
    the team I left it in the game, go find it]\n\nFixed more bugs than I have the
    heart to mention...\n\nSupported in the audio development of environmental and
    player SFX\n\nLeft an easter egg somewhere in the time\n\nAnd lastly... making
    these credits ^.^"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
