  m_text: 'Lead the development of all of the Shader Graphs used within the project
    including:


    PCG Noise value generated Cobwebs


    Stylized Water which:

    -
    accounts for colors, opacity, horizon angles, refraction UVs, posterizes depth
    steps, and extra fragments


    Rain - Reflective World Space Puddles & PCG
    noise ripple effect


    Object Outlines

    Floating/Rotating objects

    Fading
    objects

    World Spaced Textures


    Programmed functionality of the following:

    Terror
    radius & inital Heartbeat SFX

    Bedroom Clock & model

    Dynamic Material
    Swapping for fading objects & rainy textures


    Design Contributions

    Helped
    detail the tutorial, bedroom, and nightmare through iterations of various shadergraphs,
    and sporadic 3d modelling


    Pitched initial gameplay loop where the house
    turns into an inverted nightmare version


    Built the whole underground section
    for act3 of the game


    Supported the concept process with drafts of the finale,
    enemy behaviour, level layouts, as well as frequent bugfixing and refactoring
    systems


    Created the Gameplay Trailer for final launch

'
